For the first 180 days, she feeds the dog 1 cup per day:  
$$ 180 \text{ days} \times 1 \text{ cup/day} = 180 \text{ cups} $$

{Step 3: Calculate the number of days remaining in the year after the first 180 days.}  
$$ 365 - 180 = 185 \text{ days} $$

{Step 4: Calculate the number of cups needed for the remaining 185 days.}  
